@startuml
title L4 - discount_engine component: pure calculation contract\nScoped projection of MC-01; not the entire application
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
interface DiscountPolicy <<solution>> {
  +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
}
class NoDiscount <<solution>> {
  +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
}
class FixedDiscount <<solution>> {
  +amount : int {readOnly}
  +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
}
class PercentageDiscount <<solution>> {
  +basisPoints : int {readOnly}
  +discount(subtotal : int, currency : String) : int
}
NoDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
FixedDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
PercentageDiscount ..|> DiscountPolicy
note bottom of DiscountPolicy
  Parent: order_pricing -> pricing_app -> discount_engine.
  Accepted input: nonnegative integer CNY subtotal after validation/eligibility.
  Output: integer cents in 0..subtotal; deterministic; no mutation.
  Fixed discounts cap; percentages floor. Shared finite vectors are not universal proof.
  RegistryPolicyResolver is in this component but omitted from this contract-focused view.
  The complete MC-01 and DS-01 carry allocation, eligibility and call-order evidence.
end note
@enduml
